  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[C/Bb]\n[Am7]\n[G]\n[C]\n[C/Bb]\n[Am7]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Tell everybody I'm\n[C/Bb]on my way New\n[Am7]friends and new places to\n[G]see With\n[F]blue skies ahead yes I'm\n[C]on my way [G]And there's\n[Bb]nowhere else That I'd rather\n[G]be\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]Tell everybody I'm\n[C/Bb]on my way And I'm\n[Am7]loving every step I take\n[G]With the\n[F]sun beating down yes I'm\n[C]on my way [G]And I\n[Bb]can't keep this smile off my\n[G]face 'Cause there's\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]nothing like seeing Each\n[Cm]other again No\n[Ab]matter what the distance bet-\n[Bb]ween And the\n[Cm]stories that we tell\n[Gm]Will make you smile\n[Ab]Oh it\n[Bb]really lifts my heart\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C]So tell'em all I'm\n[C/Bb]on my way New\n[Am7]friends and new places to\n[G]see And to\n[F]sleep under the stars Who could\n[C]ask for more [G]With the\n[Bb]moon keeping watch over\n[G]me Not the\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]snow, not the rain Can\n[Cm]change my mind The\n[Ab]sun will come out, wait and\n[Bb]see And the\n[Cm]feeling of the wind in your\n[Gm]face Can lift your heart\n[Ab]Oh there's\n[Bb]nowhere I would rather be\n\n[Bridge]\n[G]\n[Bm/F#]'Cause I'm on my way\n[Em]now-\n[C]Well and tru-\n[G]ly\n[Bm/F#]I'm on my way\n[D]now\n\n[Break]\n[A]\n[C#m]I'm on my way\n[F#m]now\n[D]\n[A]\n[C#m]I'm on my way\n[F#m]now\n[D]\n[A]\n[C#m]I'm on my way\n[F#m]now\n[G]  [A]\n\n[Interlude]\n[D]\n[D/C]\n[Bm7]\n[A]\n\n[Outro]\n[D]Tell everybody I'm\n[D/C]on my way And I\n[Bm7]just can't wait to be there\n[A]With\n[G]blue skies ahead yes I'm\n[D]on my way [A]And\n[C]nothing but good times to\n[A]share So\n[D]tell everybody I'm\n[D/C]on my way And I\n[Bm7]just can't wait to be home\n[A]With the\n[G]sun beating down yes I'm\n[D]on my way [A]And\n[C]nothing but good times to\n[A]show I'm on my\n[D]way",
